{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（8日）早上6時49分，警方接報一名女子昏迷在旺角廣東道一幢唐樓的梯間。救援人員到場將該名40餘歲女子送往廣華醫院搶救，但延至上午7時33分不</p><p>現場是廣東道1074號2樓，梯間遺下一件衫和一隻拖鞋，有警員在場看守。警方暫列有人暈倒案，正展開調查。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129348517245489152675413.jpeg/ZhJ4xSK83A_-3wRMqezVridsUTfOcayeWGmb-Vhpm_k\" alt=\"現場是廣東道一幢唐樓梯間。\"><figcaption>現場是廣東道一幢唐樓梯間。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129348514644889600485679.jpeg/Sll-_Jl0uEJcRRnp_WRY4jpqBJEI-kslC7JR3AuyUdw\" alt=\"現場遺下一件衫。\"><figcaption>現場遺下一件衫。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129348512329502720740235.jpeg/O5wgmu1f8rgfXku65HmjnyPpdT256yh---yuHvvsrh4\" alt=\"現場是唐樓的梯間。\"><figcaption>現場是唐樓的梯間。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129348509796012032245680.jpeg/Qv65H1x1dTTHkpl2zqA8gdq5hydJgShiEKnIMhCpyDI\" alt=\"警員在場看守。\"><figcaption>警員在場看守。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260508/1129348506960531456234715.jpeg/U8rnQQmRfpI_9Www02j8y8SoqtQICk6yOLLiHziy4h8\" alt=\"警員在場看守。\"><figcaption>警員在場看守。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-08T01:26:55.840646+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}